{"ticker":"RENUKA","symbol":"RENUKA","instrumentId":3022744,"name":"Shree Renuka Sugars","industry":"NSE-Food-Packaged","about":"Shree Renuka Sugars Ltd. is one of India's largest integrated sugar manufacturers, with operations spanning sugar production, ethanol manufacturing, and power generation. The company produces refined sugar for both domestic and international markets and is a key player in the renewable energy sector through its cogeneration of power from bagasse (a byproduct of sugarcane). Shree Renuka Sugars also focuses on ethanol production, contributing to sustainable biofuel initiatives. With a global presence, including refineries in India and Brazil, the company emphasizes innovation, efficiency, and sustainability in its operations, helping meet the growing demand for renewable energy and refined sugar worldwide.","website":"www.renukasugars.com","location":"Belgaum, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:56:57.875Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":17.82,"changePct":1.0204081632653046,"week52High":29.48,"week52Low":17.35},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹3,793 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹8,847 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"808,826,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"51"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"200,021,412"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"-0.42"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.16"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.76"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"—"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"0–0"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"-32.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-0.57"},{"label":"Volume","value":"2,972,724"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"10,001,176"},{"label":"Master score","value":"20"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"14"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"9"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"122"},{"lab